5,1,1,talk,George,,"Hello everyone. It is a pleasure to be here. To ensure we find a sustainable solution for our shared car, I believe we should start by gathering some objective data. Let's be thoughtful about this.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. We should avoid making decisions based on vague impressions. Let's identify the specific data points that will reveal the actual patterns of use and the associated costs before we propose any new rules.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree with the need for objective data. To understand the actual experience of using the car, we should look at the patterns of daily use and the physical condition of the vehicle.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We need a clear understanding of the actual expenses and usage patterns to ensure the arrangement is fair. Let's be thorough in our research to avoid any misunderstandings later.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hi everyone! I'm happy to help. I want to make sure everything is fair and that we all feel good about how we use the car. I'm curious to see how it all works!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,George,,"I will look into ""What two other car-sharing households said"" and ""The spell of checking each other's figures."" I believe it is important to understand the social dynamics and pitfalls of such arrangements.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I will examine the ""Hours of use recorded in the diary"" and the ""Month's trial of recording every run."" I want to understand the actual time investment required to manage the car's usage.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I will look into the ""State of the car at handover"" and ""The mechanic's remarks at the last service."" I want to understand the actual condition of the vehicle and how it is being maintained.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I will check ""Last year's tax, insurance and parking papers"" and ""Last year's fuel receipts."" I want to get a precise picture of the total fixed and variable costs to determine what a truly even split looks like.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I'll look into ""Weeks of heavy use over the year"" and ""Trips that repeat weekly""! I want to see who uses the car the most and where it goes. It sounds interesting!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,George,,"I think we have a very comprehensive plan. By covering the social, financial, and physical aspects, we can avoid the mistakes of the past. I look forward to seeing what we all discover.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"It is a balanced approach. By dividing the research, we ensure that no single perspective dominates the decision. I will wait for the results to see if the time spent managing the car is sustainable.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. By examining the vehicle's condition alongside the usage and cost data, we can determine if the current arrangement is physically and practically sustainable for everyone involved. I look forward to the results.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Having a complete set of data will allow us to address the financial realities without relying on assumptions. I'll see you all in the next round to share our findings.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'm excited too! I hope we find out a lot of things that help us all get along. I'll go see what the car's busy weeks look like now! See you soon!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,George,,I believe we are all in agreement. Let us proceed with our research and reconvene once we have the facts. I will see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Let us proceed with the research. I will focus on the time and effort involved in the car's operation to ensure the administrative burden is manageable. I will see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will focus on the physical state of the car. It is essential to know if the vehicle is being kept in a condition that is safe and reliable for everyone. I will see you all soon.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will begin my research now. I want to ensure we have a precise understanding of the financial history to avoid any hidden imbalances. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'll go look at the papers now! I hope the information is easy to understand. I'll see you all in the next round! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
